WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.722 --> 00:00:02.050
Riesci a restare su?

2
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.971
Dodici criceti.

3
00:00:04.351 --> 00:00:05.891
Una minuscola isola.

4
00:00:06.111 --> 00:00:07.812
Carica lo scatto...

5
00:00:08.372 --> 00:00:09.332
e falli volare.

6
00:00:09.552 --> 00:00:11.092
Prendi un'abilità.

7
00:00:11.232 --> 00:00:13.813
Esplosione, blocco o scambio...

8
00:00:14.213 --> 00:00:15.093
via dai guai!

9
00:00:15.704 --> 00:00:16.774
Sette mappe.

10
00:00:17.014 --> 00:00:18.214
Facciamo girare...

11
00:00:18.734 --> 00:00:19.494
Vulcano!

12
00:00:19.747 --> 00:00:21.175
Occhio a dove rotoli.

13
00:00:21.735 --> 00:00:22.855
Cinque modalità.

14
00:00:23.215 --> 00:00:29.337
Lotta per sopravvivere, corri al traguardo,
ruba la bandiera o esplora in libertà.

15
00:00:29.657 --> 00:00:31.417
Invita i tuoi amici.

16
00:00:31.747 --> 00:00:35.978
Condividi un codice, forma un
gruppo e tuffatevi insieme nel caos.

17
00:00:36.138 --> 00:00:37.739
Chi sta salvando chi?

18
00:00:38.099 --> 00:00:39.179
E adesso...

19
00:00:39.566 --> 00:00:40.539
il giro dei premi.

20
00:00:40.859 --> 00:00:41.820
Dai...

21
00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:42.780
dai...

22
00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:43.740
sì!

23
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.195
Novantadue look.

24
00:00:45.348 --> 00:00:50.016
Ventitré criceti, ventinove palle e trenta scie.

25
00:00:50.982 --> 00:00:52.462
Scegli la dolcezza.

26
00:00:52.602 --> 00:00:54.062
Punta alle stelle.

27
00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:55.263
Scatenati un po'.

28
00:00:55.479 --> 00:00:58.143
Combina criceto, palla e scia.

29
00:00:58.323 --> 00:00:59.344
Tre pezzi.

30
00:00:59.464 --> 00:01:00.944
Un look tutto tuo.

31
00:01:01.544 --> 00:01:03.105
Pronti per un altro round?

32
00:01:03.265 --> 00:01:04.705
Hamster Bounce.

33
00:01:04.865 --> 00:01:05.745
Rotola.

34
00:01:05.845 --> 00:01:06.625
Carica.

35
00:01:06.889 --> 00:01:07.746
Falli volare.

36
00:01:07.882 --> 00:01:09.666
Scaricalo su Google Play.
